* text=auto eol=lf

*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown

# The grid rasters are Int16 little-endian, read straight into an
# Int16Array. Git's binary detection is a heuristic over the first few
# kilobytes, and a raster whose leading cells all fall outside the district
# is a long run of the same two bytes — so this is stated rather than left to
# be guessed. A single CRLF substitution inside one of these shifts every
# value after it and silently corrupts the district.
*.bin binary
